      "initialText": "FIELD KILN\nObjects for everyday rituals\nFictional studio · Shop simulation\nThe collection / Everyday Teapot\nFIELD NOTES / 001\n01 — Everyday Teapot, illustrated in Iron\n\nOriginal vector illustration of a fictional sample product; not a photograph. Illustration shows Iron only.\n\nMade for the daily pour.\n\nA handmade ceramic teapot in glazed stoneware, with a round body, fitted lid and curved handle.\n\nMaterial\nGlazed stoneware\nCapacity\n650 ml\nDimensions\n16 cm wide × 12 cm high\nCare for your piece\n\nHand wash. Avoid sudden temperature changes. Not for stovetop use.\n\nHANDMADE STONEWARE / 650 ML\n\nEveryday\nTeapot\n\n$68\nUSD / piece\n\nA quiet companion for your tea ritual.\n\nMaterial, dimensions & care ↓\n\n01 Choose your glaze\nIron\n4 in stock\nAsh\nUnavailable\nSand\n7 in stock\n02 Quantity\n1\n2\n3\n4\nDelivery\n\n$8.00 flat shipping. Dispatch in 2 business days; illustrative domestic transit 3–5 business days.\n\nReturns\n\nUnused pieces accepted within 30 days. Customer pays return shipping; original shipping is nonrefundable.\n\n1 piece\nUSD 68.00\nShipping\nUSD 8.00\nTotal, shipping included\nUSD 76.00\nAdd to simulated cart\n↗\n\nA local demonstration. No payment or real order.\n\nFIELD KILN\n\nFictional shop and illustrative product, price, stock, delivery, and returns.",
